tsv_html includes the WHATWG HTML Living Standard's list of named character references.

  Source:   https://html.spec.whatwg.org/entities.json
  Files:    src/entities.json (the data), src/entities_table.rs (generated from it)
  Changes:  each entry is reduced to its name without the leading `&` and the characters
            it stands for (the `codepoints` arrays are dropped), and the generated file
            restates the list as a Rust perfect hash table (each name and its characters
            in the slot the table's hash assigns it).

